        "reason": "The manifest and generated data identify the current bytes, but the historical SHA256SUMS preimage is unavailable in the allowed branch history. A stale-metadata-only conclusion is not established. This pass also finds a substantive L08 source-scope conflict, which must be resolved independently of checksum metadata.",
