      "issue_id": "ISS-RS-RS-001-001",
      "disposition": {
        "type": "canonical_update",
        "state": "proposed",
        "action": "Split requirement eligibility from damage recipients and preserve the player-selected target; correct L08 data and derived content together. Preserve the original source text with an authority-backed interpretation. PM may seek owner clarification if the v12 sentence is intended as an explicit exception, but no such exception is established in supplied sources."
      }
    },
