        "type": "canonical_update",
        "state": "proposed",
        "action": "Make healing target scope explicit in the assigned data/schema and regression expectations, then obtain an explicitly authorized engine task to apply source-scoped healing. The generic helper is an implementation defect even though the data currently lacks an explicit heal-target field."
      }
    },
